            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## What's new in 1.1.0

- **Settings window** — pick your primary zone, show/hide zones, and configure everything below.
- **Per-zone volume** — each active zone gets its own slider, folded into the System panel.
- **Lyrics panel** — fetches lyrics for the current song. Choose your source: LRCLIB (free), Google Gemini, or Exa (both via your own API key).
- **Recently played** — the last 10 songs, even captured while the menu was closed. Click any to open it in Apple Music.
- **Customizable shortcuts** — rebind the in-menu shortcuts and the global play/pause hotkey (default F8).
- **Auto-updates** via Sparkle.
- **Self-healing connection** — automatically reconnects after sleep or switching networks, instead of getting stuck.
]]></description>
